   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "b_t2b",
   "x": 130,
   "y": 706,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "It ASKS you about every TODO, then RUNS each command to prove\nit works. Also checks the e2e engine: `agent-browser doctor`\n(Chrome required; ffmpeg only for the video). Two it will push on:\n  \u2022 does your test command actually EXIT? (watch mode hangs)\n  \u2022 what proves the app is up? (a 200 can be another process)",
   "originalText": "It ASKS you about every TODO, then RUNS each command to prove\nit works. Also checks the e2e engine: `agent-browser doctor`\n(Chrome required; ffmpeg only for the video). Two it will push on:\n  \u2022 does your test command actually EXIT? (watch mode hangs)\n  \u2022 what proves the app is up? (a 200 can be another process)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
