  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d_e2e_n",
   "x": 1665,
   "y": 1252,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 100,
   "text": "A fresh browser agent drives the LIVE app via agent-browser\n(the orchestrator starts the app). No UI here? Record\n\"N/A \u2014 <reason>\". Never a silent skip.\n\nRaw trace + media stay gitignored. Before any retry or halt,\npromote-e2e redacts inputs and saves a tracked scenario with\nprerequisites, locators, actions, assertions and cleanup.",
   "originalText": "A fresh browser agent drives the LIVE app via agent-browser\n(the orchestrator starts the app). No UI here? Record\n\"N/A \u2014 <reason>\". Never a silent skip.\n\nRaw trace + media stay gitignored. Before any retry or halt,\npromote-e2e redacts inputs and saves a tracked scenario with\nprerequisites, locators, actions, assertions and cleanup.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
