  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d_arch_t",
   "x": 1350,
   "y": 1478,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 60,
   "text": "5. COUPLING CHECK\nonly if a later phase\nreally depends on this",
   "originalText": "5. COUPLING CHECK\nonly if a later phase\nreally depends on this",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 400043,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 400044,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": "d_arch",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d_arch_n",
   "x": 1660,
   "y": 1430,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "Phases are often INDEPENDENT \u2014 UI, then backend,\nthen a migration; different screens, different layers,\nsometimes different stacks. There is no \u201cphase 1 sets\nthe pattern\u201d rule, because usually there is no pattern.\n\nFires ONLY on evidence of real coupling:\n  \u2022 a later phase's plan names a file this phase created\n  \u2022 a new type already repeats in \u22652 files of its own diff\n  \u2022 \u22653 files outside one folder (shotgun surgery)\n\nOn a PRD of unrelated phases it fires ZERO times \u2014\nthat is correct, not a miss.",
   "originalText": "Phases are often INDEPENDENT \u2014 UI, then backend,\nthen a migration; different screens, different layers,\nsometimes different stacks. There is no \u201cphase 1 sets\nthe pattern\u201d rule, because usually there is no pattern.\n\nFires ONLY on evidence of real coupling:\n  \u2022 a later phase's plan names a file this phase created\n  \u2022 a new type already repeats in \u22652 files of its own diff\n  \u2022 \u22653 files outside one folder (shotgun surgery)\n\nOn a PRD of unrelated phases it fires ZERO times \u2014\nthat is correct, not a miss.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 400045,
