  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d_gate_t",
   "x": 145,
   "y": 1948,
   "width": 1450,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "WHAT STOPS A COMMIT OR THE NEXT PHASE \u2014 even when you chose full autonomy.  Autonomy speeds the happy path; it does not lower the bar.\n\n   red build or tests, past the retry cap  \u2192  phase marked  failed,  quarantined, run continues with the phases that don't depend on it\n   e2e still failing, or blocked         \u2192  same. A UI phase NEVER commits on an unresolved or un-run e2e gate\n   a  one_way  deviation on this phase    \u2192  phase marked  held.  Work stays in the tree, run moves to the next independent phase\n   running cost crosses max_cost_usd      \u2192  emit budget_exceeded, HALT before the next phase, surface it, wait for you\n\nA parked phase does not stop independent work. A crossed budget always stops new spend.",
   "originalText": "WHAT STOPS A COMMIT OR THE NEXT PHASE \u2014 even when you chose full autonomy.  Autonomy speeds the happy path; it does not lower the bar.\n\n   red build or tests, past the retry cap  \u2192  phase marked  failed,  quarantined, run continues with the phases that don't depend on it\n   e2e still failing, or blocked         \u2192  same. A UI phase NEVER commits on an unresolved or un-run e2e gate\n   a  one_way  deviation on this phase    \u2192  phase marked  held.  Work stays in the tree, run moves to the next independent phase\n   running cost crosses max_cost_usd      \u2192  emit budget_exceeded, HALT before the next phase, surface it, wait for you\n\nA parked phase does not stop independent work. A crossed budget always stops new spend.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 400065,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 400066,
   "isDeleted": false,
