  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "e_code_t",
   "x": 2168,
   "y": 1644,
   "width": 1120,
   "height": 165,
   "text": "## 1. \u26a0 one-way \u00b7 schema \u00b7 Phase 2            \u2190 from deviations-<prd>.md\n**PRD said** (\u00a79): \"Phase 4 reserves the only migration; earlier phases add no persisted columns.\"\n**Built instead:** a mirror model + EF config + DbSet, added in Phase 2.\n**Why:** the API context owns no migrations, so the entity could not be read at all.\n**Where:** src/\u2026/Migrations/20260824_AddEmpReportSettings.cs:1\n**Verify in 30s:** git log --oneline -- src/\u2026/Migrations/ | head -3\n\n_18 lower-level decisions were absorbed and are not listed._   \u2190 proves the filter RAN",
   "originalText": "## 1. \u26a0 one-way \u00b7 schema \u00b7 Phase 2            \u2190 from deviations-<prd>.md\n**PRD said** (\u00a79): \"Phase 4 reserves the only migration; earlier phases add no persisted columns.\"\n**Built instead:** a mirror model + EF config + DbSet, added in Phase 2.\n**Why:** the API context owns no migrations, so the entity could not be read at all.\n**Where:** src/\u2026/Migrations/20260824_AddEmpReportSettings.cs:1\n**Verify in 30s:** git log --oneline -- src/\u2026/Migrations/ | head -3\n\n_18 lower-level decisions were absorbed and are not listed._   \u2190 proves the filter RAN",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 500045,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 500046,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "e_code_c",
   "x": 2150,
   "y": 1830,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "Every field is machine-checked: the quote must really be in the PRD, the path must resolve, one-way must match a real blast radius.\nA record that fails is DROPPED from the report and listed as malformed \u2014 never blocked, never silently hidden.",
   "originalText": "Every field is machine-checked: the quote must really be in the PRD, the path must resolve, one-way must match a real blast radius.\nA record that fails is DROPPED from the report and listed as malformed \u2014 never blocked, never silently hidden.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
