  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "f_out",
   "x": 1480,
   "y": 2285,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "1  report      \u2192 deviations-<prd>.md, top 3 printed into your pane\n2  drift       \u2192 which generated docs this run made stale\n3  testdocs    \u2192 rollups built from already-tracked scenario documents\n4  learnings   \u2192 tally each finding; flags a class seen 3x across 2 PRDs\n5  telemetry   \u2192 wall time + tokens + est. $cost + fix-cycles vs your estimate  (worth it?)\n6  PRESENT, never apply, any edit to AGENTS.md / standards / CLAUDE.md\n7  sweep the panes, kill the app, one line to the daily log\n\n   + if you asked for them at kickoff:\n     \u00b7 post the deviations as a ticket COMMENT (not an attachment)\n     \u00b7 open a DRAFT pull request",
   "originalText": "1  report      \u2192 deviations-<prd>.md, top 3 printed into your pane\n2  drift       \u2192 which generated docs this run made stale\n3  testdocs    \u2192 rollups built from already-tracked scenario documents\n4  learnings   \u2192 tally each finding; flags a class seen 3x across 2 PRDs\n5  telemetry   \u2192 wall time + tokens + est. $cost + fix-cycles vs your estimate  (worth it?)\n6  PRESENT, never apply, any edit to AGENTS.md / standards / CLAUDE.md\n7  sweep the panes, kill the app, one line to the daily log\n\n   + if you asked for them at kickoff:\n     \u00b7 post the deviations as a ticket COMMENT (not an attachment)\n     \u00b7 open a DRAFT pull request",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
