  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "g_3t",
   "x": 2170,
   "y": 2210,
   "width": 1110,
   "height": 62,
   "text": "3.  THE APP NEVER CAME UP \u2014 the e2e gate times out\n     `app-run.sh wait-ready` failing is a TYPED failure, not an infra stall: read the app\n     pane for the startup error. Usually the readiness probe is wrong (a bare port answers\n     but the app isn't serving) or a prerequisite (DB/container) is down. Fix `[app].ready_probe`.",
   "originalText": "3.  THE APP NEVER CAME UP \u2014 the e2e gate times out\n     `app-run.sh wait-ready` failing is a TYPED failure, not an infra stall: read the app\n     pane for the startup error. Usually the readiness probe is wrong (a bare port answers\n     but the app isn't serving) or a prerequisite (DB/container) is down. Fix `[app].ready_probe`.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 700015,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700016,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "g_4",
   "x": 2150,
   "y": 2292,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 86,
   "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f",
   "backgroundColor": "#93c5fd",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
