  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "g_4t",
   "x": 2170,
   "y": 2306,
   "width": 1110,
   "height": 62,
   "text": "4.  A WORKER STOPPED WITHOUT ITS FILE \u2014 a hook makes this loud instead of silent\n     A worker cannot end its turn without writing its artifact; it is told to go back and finish.\n     After 3 refusals it writes GATE-FAILED, so you get a TYPED failure rather than a mystery idle pane.",
   "originalText": "4.  A WORKER STOPPED WITHOUT ITS FILE \u2014 a hook makes this loud instead of silent\n     A worker cannot end its turn without writing its artifact; it is told to go back and finish.\n     After 3 refusals it writes GATE-FAILED, so you get a TYPED failure rather than a mystery idle pane.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
