  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "h_foot",
   "x": 2580,
   "y": 2980,
   "width": 760,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "Full detail lives in SKILL.md and reference/.\nThis diagram is the map; the skill is the loop.\n\nNew repo? `orchestrator.py install` + the orchestrator-setup\nskill. e2e needs agent-browser on PATH (ffmpeg for video).",
   "originalText": "Full detail lives in SKILL.md and reference/.\nThis diagram is the map; the skill is the loop.\n\nNew repo? `orchestrator.py install` + the orchestrator-setup\nskill. e2e needs agent-browser on PATH (ffmpeg for video).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
